Reflection

Completing Meow reinforced a fundamental principle of offensive security:

Do not attack what you do not understand. Enumerate first, analyse the evidence, identify the attack surface and then test the most relevant attack path.

This machine represents another practical step in my cybersecurity learning journey, particularly in developing the reconnaissance and enumeration discipline required for more advanced penetration-testing labs.
